# Complete Monitoring Flow

```text
Node Exporter
      |
      | Metrics
      v
Prometheus
      |
      | Stores Metrics in TSDB
      |
      | Evaluates Alert Rules
      |
      +-------------> Grafana
      |                 |
      |                 | Dashboards
      |                 |
      v
Alertmanager
      |
      | Notifications
      v
PagerDuty / Slack / Email
```

---

# Interview Summary

Prometheus periodically scrapes metrics from exporters, stores them in its Time Series Database (TSDB), evaluates alerting rules, sends alerts to Alertmanager, and serves metric data to Grafana through PromQL queries.
